  "description": "Type-safe ontology definition layer for domain modeling. Provides descriptors, builders, and a fluent DSL for defining object types, links, actions, events, and interfaces across domains. Includes embedding abstractions (IEmbeddingProvider), text chunking (ITextChunker with sentence, paragraph, and fixed-size strategies), an ingestion pipeline (IngestionPipeline), and an InMemoryObjectSetProvider for development and testing.",
